    <briefdescription>
<para>Extended diagnostic record with high-churn and tracing context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Backward-compatible extension of <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_diagnostic_record" kindref="compound">DiagnosticRecord</ref> from <ref refid="process__diagnostics_8h" kindref="compound">process_diagnostics.h</ref>. Adds optional context for high-churn scenarios and distributed tracing.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Base <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_diagnostic_record" kindref="compound">DiagnosticRecord</ref> fields (timestamp_ms, incident_type, error_code, etc.) are always present </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Extended fields (trace_context, churn_metric, conflict_analysis) are optional </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>All fields are immutable after construction </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
